// builtin/reflect/Raw.frond — reflect primitive declarations (placeholder).
//
// Historically this file declared @builtin primitives whose implementations
// were Rust-side #[no_mangle] fns dispatched via FFI (REFLECT_ENTRIES + CF_FFI_CALL).
//
// That entire path has been eliminated. Reflect operations are now:
//   1. Auto-impl trait methods on every value (trait Type / trait Value),
//      recognized structurally at Sema (Inference) and lowered at IR build
//      (Builder::reflect_method_intrinsic → CF_REFLECT_* compute_fns).
//   2. No top-level wrappers — call sites use the method form directly
//      (e.g. Console.frond `print<T>` writes `x.format()`).
//
// No @builtin declarations remain. This file is kept as an empty placeholder
// so the `builtin/reflect/` module layout stays stable; it contributes no
// declarations to the environment.
